  "rationale": "We are escalating this claim to a senior adjuster because the total amount of loss is at or above the $30,000 high-value referral threshold. Clause STD-6.1 explicitly governs this by requiring any claim with an amount of loss at or above $30,000 to be escalated before payment is authorized. The key fact is that the itemized damages total $43,190.00.",
